{"3868900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Venison County", "steam_appid": 3868900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4971440], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/cd9b25ff9c22f0eab001880568c346a6.poster.avif?t=1787689782\" width=614 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/cd9b25ff9c22f0eab001880568c346a6.webm?t=1787689782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/cd9b25ff9c22f0eab001880568c346a6.mp4?t=1787689782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your sawed-off, cast some sigils, and face the never ending nightmare head on in <strong>Venison County</strong>. Blast your old neighbors into undead venison giblets, master weapon specific active reloads, and limitlessly combine slain cultists' sigils for their sinful buffs (if you can withstand God's wrath).  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/626e3f5d950baea4b77e54d6d64fdfae.poster.avif?t=1787689782\" width=614 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/626e3f5d950baea4b77e54d6d64fdfae.webm?t=1787689782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine Sigils Endlessly.</strong> Make your bullets explosive, homing, piercing missiles that gib all on-screen foes in an instant. Launch yourself into the air with massively buffed recoil. Shred foes with a barrage of rapid-fire pitchfork jabs. The build possibilities are endless, thanks to Appalachian black magic. Experiment with 50+ sigils and their limitless synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/0ae8ac5b545d422fb358210531ad7215.poster.avif?t=1787689782\" width=614 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/0ae8ac5b545d422fb358210531ad7215.webm?t=1787689782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Reload Sequence for Each Gun.</strong> Master each of 12 different guns' respective reloads. Wait for a breather and reload them at your own pace, or reload mid-battle and risk dropping precious ammo or being overwhelmed. With each gun's sequence having unique pacing, difficulty, and sound effects, a gun's reload is as distinctive as its shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/0247c9d0d41a019c0cc61d35bd4a5ade.poster.avif?t=1787689782\" width=614 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/0247c9d0d41a019c0cc61d35bd4a5ade.webm?t=1787689782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wade in the Blood of an Endless Onslaught.</strong> Every new day comes with a dynamically curated onslaught of enemies. They won't stop coming until you die. Cause insurmountable carnage, and soak the earth in blood and gibs inspired by retro gorefest classics such as <i>Blood</i> 1997 and <i>Quake</i> 1996.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/ed6c4f0c74d66fcf6da5b990b6586067.webp?t=1787689782\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/ed6c4f0c74d66fcf6da5b990b6586067.poster.avif?t=1787689782\" class=\"bb_img\" width=488 height=93 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access exclusive playtests, chat with the developers, and join hundreds of Venison County fans in the Discord, linked in the sidebar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/2df811eb619b38ccc0705570dcfdf372.poster.avif?t=1787689782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/2df811eb619b38ccc0705570dcfdf372.webm?t=1787689782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/cd9b25ff9c22f0eab001880568c346a6.poster.avif?t=1787689782\" width=614 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/cd9b25ff9c22f0eab001880568c346a6.webm?t=1787689782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868900/extras/cd9b25ff9c22f0eab001880568c346a6.mp4?t=1787689782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your sawed-off, cast some sigils, and face the never ending nightmare head on in <strong>Venison County</strong>. Blast your old neighbors into undead venison giblets, master weapon specific active reloads, and limitlessly combine slain cultists' sigils for their sinful buffs (